---
layout: base.njk
title: Commission
---

<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">

  <h1 class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl font-light text-charcoal mb-4">Commission</h1>
  <p class="font-body text-ash text-lg mb-16 leading-relaxed">
    Every piece in this portfolio was made for a specific person and place.<br>
    Yours can be too.
  </p>

  {# Process steps #}
  <div class="space-y-12 mb-20">
    {% set steps = [
      { n: "01", title: "Begin a conversation", body: "Send a message describing what you have in mind — the space, the function, the feeling you're after. No brief is too vague to start." },
      { n: "02", title: "Scope and design", body: "We'll talk through materials, dimensions, joinery, and timeline. I'll sketch options and we'll land on a design that's right for your space." },
      { n: "03", title: "Proposal and deposit", body: "You'll receive a written proposal with pricing and an estimated completion date. A 50% deposit confirms the commission and reserves your place in the queue." },
      { n: "04", title: "Build", body: "I'll keep you informed as the piece takes shape — progress photos, material choices, and any decisions that arise in the making." },
      { n: "05", title: "Delivery", body: "Most pieces are delivered in person within the Bay Area. Crating and freight can be arranged for pieces going further." }
    ] %}
    {% for step in steps %}
    <div class="flex gap-8">
      <div class="font-display text-5xl font-light text-ash shrink-0">{{ step.n }}</div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-light text-charcoal mb-2">{{ step.title }}</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-charcoal leading-relaxed">{{ step.body }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  {# Form #}
  <div class="border-t border-ash pt-16">
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-light text-charcoal mb-8">Get in touch</h2>

    <form name="commission" method="POST" netlify class="space-y-6">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="commission">

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div>
          <label class="block font-ui text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-ash mb-2">Name</label>
          <input type="text" name="name" required
                 class="w-full bg-paper border border-ash px-4 py-3 font-body text-charcoal focus:border-charcoal focus:outline-none transition-colors">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block font-ui text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-ash mb-2">Email</label>
          <input type="email" name="email" required
                 class="w-full bg-paper border border-ash px-4 py-3 font-body text-charcoal focus:border-charcoal focus:outline-none transition-colors">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <label class="block font-ui text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-ash mb-2">What do you have in mind?</label>
        <textarea name="message" rows="6" required
                  class="w-full bg-paper border border-ash px-4 py-3 font-body text-charcoal focus:border-charcoal focus:outline-none transition-colors resize-none"></textarea>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <button type="submit"
                class="font-ui text-xs tracking-widest uppercase bg-charcoal text-ground px-8 py-3 hover:bg-cedar transition-colors">
          Send
        </button>
        <p class="font-ui text-xs text-ash">
          Or email directly: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" class="text-charcoal hover:text-cedar transition-colors">{{ site.email }}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>

</div>
